    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_output">PCM parameters above are post-decode, after DSP/format processing.

“AAudio / OpenSL ES (Oboe)” mode: Oboe opens the native output stream, and the Media3 DSP/format chain runs before writing; exclusive mode is only requested for compatible AAudio USB DACs and Oboe falls back to shared mode on failure. The native endpoint uses the PCM format negotiated by Oboe.
“System” mode: routes through the Android AudioTrack system mixer for better compatibility, with playback speed and silence-skip support.</string>
